        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-blue-500/20 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <strong class="text-blue-400">Currency Conversion Standard:</strong> The conversion rate applied by Japanese consulates is calculated using the official exchange rate published by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MOFA) at the exact time of formal application receipt. Savings or liquid investment balances cannot substitute for recurrent earned professional income.
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
