        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. The 49 Eligible Treaty Nations</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain reciprocity and ensure tax compliance, Japan exclusively offers this visa to nationals of countries that meet two distinct international criteria:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Short-Stay Visa Waiver Agreement:</strong> Must hold a passport eligible for 90-day visa-free entry into Japan.</li>
          <li><strong>Bilateral Double Taxation Avoidance Treaty:</strong> Must be a signatory to an active income tax convention with the Government of Japan.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 my-6">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Key Eligible Jurisdictions</h3>
